{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:ffc0dea5f05c174a","name":"Signature Device","source":{"id":"source:reference-ffc0dea5f05c174a","title":"Signature Device","revision":19768,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:34:36Z","sha256":"9d01fbe9828285bdfd584e7265a97c5c2fe2f5118e7676a26602fe526791321b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19768","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Signature%20Device&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-ffc0dea5f05c174a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You specialize in designing and modifying specific types of technology.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tech Specialist"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tech_Specialist","referenceId":"reference:62e86e4173a4731b"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," You designate a single weapon, suit of armor, vehicle, or other item as your Signature Item. When making ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," checks to modify that piece of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"},", you can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 10"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_10"}," on the check. In addition, you can allow the device to gain two Traits from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tech Specialist"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tech_Specialist","referenceId":"reference:62e86e4173a4731b"}," feat.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["To install the second Trait, you must succeed on a DC 30 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check. Once installed, the device can use only one Trait at a time, and switching from one Trait to the other requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to adjust the item's settings.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can have only one Signature Device at a time, but you can designate another device as your Signature Item (the former item loses all benefits gained from this feat).\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
